## OrchestratorTaskMeta

**File:** `packages/smithy/src/types/task-meta.ts` (from `@stoneforge/smithy`)

Orchestrator-specific metadata attached to tasks managed by the orchestration system. Stored in the task's `metadata` field under the `orchestrator` key.

```typescript
task.metadata = {
  ...existingMetadata,
  orchestrator: OrchestratorTaskMeta
}
```

### Key Fields

| Field | Type | Description |
|-------|------|-------------|
| `branch` | `string` | Git branch created for this task |
| `worktree` | `string` | Path to the agent's worktree |
| `targetBranch` | `string` | Target branch for merging this task. Inherited from the owning director at dispatch time. Falls back to workspace default if not set. |
| `sessionId` | `string` | Claude Code session ID for resumption |
| `assignedAgent` | `EntityId` | Entity ID of the assigned agent |
| `owningDirector` | `EntityId` | Entity ID of the director that created/owns this task for message routing |
| `startedAt` | `Timestamp` | When the agent started working |
| `completedAt` | `Timestamp` | When the agent completed (before merge) |
| `mergedAt` | `Timestamp` | When the branch was merged |
| `mergeStatus` | `MergeStatus` | Merge process status |
| `mergeFailureReason` | `string` | Reason if merge failed |
| `testRunCount` | `number` | Number of test runs on this branch |
| `lastTestResult` | `TestResult` | Last test result (see `TestResult` interface below) |
| `reconciliationCount` | `number` | Times reconciled from closed-but-unmerged |
| `stuckMergeRecoveryCount` | `number` | Times recovered from stuck merging/testing |
| `stewardRecoveryCount` | `number` | Times steward orphan recovery re-dispatched |
| `resumeCount` | `number` | Consecutive orphan recovery resumes without status change |
| `reportedIssues` | `readonly string[]` | Issue types reported (prevents duplicates) |
| `handoffBranch` | `string` | Branch preserved from handoff |
| `handoffWorktree` | `string` | Worktree path preserved from handoff |
| `lastSessionId` | `string` | Session ID of the last agent before handoff |
| `handoffAt` | `Timestamp` | When the task was handed off |
| `handoffFrom` | `EntityId` | Entity ID of the agent who handed off |
| `handoffHistory` | `HandoffHistoryEntry[]` | History of all handoffs |
| `mergeRequestUrl` | `string` | URL of the merge request created for this task |
| `mergeRequestId` | `number` | Merge request identifier (e.g. PR number) |
| `mergeRequestProvider` | `string` | Which provider created the MR (e.g. 'github', 'local') |
| `completionSummary` | `string` | Completion summary provided by the agent |
| `mergeCommitHash` | `string` | Git commit hash from the squash-merge into the target branch |
| `lastCommitHash` | `string` | Last commit hash before completion |
| `sessionHistory` | `readonly TaskSessionHistoryEntry[]` | History of all sessions |
| `lastSyncResult` | `SyncResultMeta` | Most recent branch sync result |

All fields are optional.

### Key Functions

- `getOrchestratorTaskMeta(taskMetadata)` — Extracts orchestrator metadata from a task
- `setOrchestratorTaskMeta(existingMetadata, orchestratorMeta)` — Sets orchestrator metadata
- `updateOrchestratorTaskMeta(existingMetadata, updates)` — Partial update of orchestrator metadata
- `isOrchestratorTaskMeta(value)` — Type guard (validates field types if present)

### MergeStatus

```typescript
type MergeStatus = 'pending' | 'testing' | 'merging' | 'merged' | 'conflict' | 'test_failed' | 'failed' | 'not_applicable' | 'awaiting_approval';
```

