### SettingsService

Created via `createSettingsService(storage: StorageBackend)`.

```typescript
import { createSettingsService, type SettingsService } from '@stoneforge/smithy';

const settingsService = createSettingsService(storageBackend);
```

#### Methods

| Method | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `getSetting(key: string): Setting \| undefined` | Get a setting by key |
| `setSetting(key: string, value: unknown): Setting` | Set a setting (upsert) |
| `deleteSetting(key: string): boolean` | Delete a setting |
| `getAgentDefaults(): ServerAgentDefaults` | Get agent defaults (typed convenience) |
| `setAgentDefaults(defaults: ServerAgentDefaults): ServerAgentDefaults` | Update agent defaults (typed convenience) |
| `getExternalSyncSettings(): ExternalSyncSettings` | Get external sync settings (typed convenience) |
