2. Add/update test: after a rate limit timer expires naturally (without manual wake), `hasRecentRateLimitPattern` should return false for stale patterns (sessions older than `RATE_LIMIT_SESSION_GAP_MS`)
3. Existing test from cedf0a36 (stale pattern recency) should be reinstated if it was removed

